  "bodyHash": "f14YnzjqJ1w=",
  "content": "<p>此模組可讓玩家與實體裝備的盔甲/鞘翅/<del>挽具</del>以3D方式呈現，並相容於大多數標準盔甲模組、染料與裝飾紋理，同時支援16x資源包。</p><p>本專案仍處於測試階段，因此可能會有少量視覺錯誤。雖然已採取廣泛措施防止幀數下降，但在大量穿戴盔甲的實體聚集區域，效能仍可能降低。這是因為動態盔甲模型確保了所有盔甲的相容性，但即便使用了最佳化模組，仍會帶來輕微的效能負擔。</p><p>🔗&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/armor-3d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">亦可於基岩版使用</a></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>🟠 規劃中的功能</h2><ul>\n<li>3D鞍具（支援模組/資源包）</li>\n<li>3D地獄幽靈挽具（支援模組/資源包）</li>\n<li>3D狼鎧（支援模組/資源包）</li>\n<li>3D馬鎧（支援模組/資源包）</li>\n<li>3D鸚鵡螺盔甲（支援模組/資源包）</li>\n<li>更佳的最佳化</li>\n<li>支援32x資源包</li>\n<li>相容Curios API</li>\n</ul><h2>🔵 必要依賴</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Features</a>（2.4或更高版本）</li>\n</ul><h2>🟢 相容性列表</h2><p>⚠️ 可運作，但非預期效果。</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skin-layers-3d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">3D Skin Layers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a>（及所有擴展）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ftras-fresh-player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Player</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Not Enough Animations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/first-person-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">First-person Model</a></li>\n<li>⚠️&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/show-me-your-skin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Show Me Your Skin!</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-physics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elytra Physics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether</a>（手套與吊墜）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded Combat</a>（護臂）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MmmMmmMmmMmm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illagers-wear-armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Illagers Wear Armor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corpse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Corpse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-paper-doll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Paper Doll</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-npc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy NPC</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/straw-statues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Straw Statues</a></li>\n</ul><h2>🔴 不相容列表</h2><p>任何新增盔甲層的模組目前均不相容。3D鞘翅與地獄幽靈挽具在所有需要自訂模型的動畫紋理包（如Fresh Animations和Fresh Moves）中將會失效。未來將會釋出修補程式！</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/i-see-my-armored-hand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">I See My Armored Hand</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-armor-layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Armor Layer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/female-gender\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Female Gender Mod</a></li>\n</ul>",
